  <p id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:inlaw" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:inlaw:m0000" ref="412_2d3_654">玠</persName><persName id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:inlaw:m0001" ref="591_360_8ca_E">妻</persName>父<persName id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:inlaw:m0003" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName>，有海內重名，議者以為「婦公冰清，女婿玉潤。」</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:widower" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-036-jin043-leguang:widower:m0000" ref="412_2d3_654">玠</persName>妻先亡。</p>
